      "message": "Why specifically VALID_PAGE? It seems to be mostly a KVM MMU thing (for checking if a MMU root is allocated)?\n\nBTW, am I correct that we have here the same problem as in various \"TODO: Assume host is already share ...\" comments in arch/x86/kvm/pkvm/pkvm.c (i.e. the host should explicitly share/unshare this buffer with pKVM, and pKVM should pin/unpin it, to prevent e.g. donating it to a pVM while pKVM is dumping vmexit data to it)?",
